This directory includes wpa-supplicant recipe and files for MACsec MKA with hardware offload.

Upgraded from wpa_supplicant 2.10 to 2.11. The custom hw_offload patch is no longer needed
as 2.11 has native MACsec hardware offload support via the macsec_offload config option.

Key changes from the previous recipe:
- SRCREV updated to hostap_2_11 tag (d4f124e5e112ba1a83fe39dce1e8a788e18c0e40)
- Removed wpa_supplicant_macsec_hw_offload.patch (functionality is upstream in 2.11)
- Added macsec_offload=2 (MACSEC_OFFLOAD_MAC) to wpa_supplicant.conf-adrv906x
